#. Tag: title
#: index.docbook:278
#, no-c-format
msgid "Frequently asked questions"
msgstr ""

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:283
#, no-c-format
msgid "Who made this game?"
msgstr ""

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:284
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"The kdegames team. You can find their website <ulink url=\"http://games.kde."
"org\">here</ulink>."
msgstr ""

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:287
#, no-c-format
msgid "Where can I get cheatcodes?"
msgstr ""

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:288
#, no-c-format
msgid "You cannot get cheatcodes for &kde; games."
msgstr ""

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:291
#, no-c-format
msgid "How do I start a new game?"
msgstr ""

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:295
#, no-c-format
msgid "How do I restart the game?"
msgstr ""

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:296
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"To restart the game you can use <link linkend=\"game-menu-new"
"\"><menuchoice><guimenu>Game</guimenu><guimenuitem>New</guimenuitem></"
"menuchoice></link> option on the menubar."
msgstr ""

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:299
#, no-c-format
msgid "How do I pause the game?"
msgstr ""

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:300
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"To pause &kappname; you can use <link linkend=\"game-menu-pause"
"\"><menuchoice><guimenu>Game</guimenu><guimenuitem>Pause</guimenuitem></"
"menuchoice></link> option on the menubar."
msgstr ""

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:303
#, no-c-format
msgid "I want to change the way this game looks. Can I?"
msgstr ""

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:304
#, no-c-format
msgid "Explain how the theme selector works."
msgstr ""

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:307
#, no-c-format
msgid "I have made a mistake. Can I undo?"
msgstr ""

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:308
#, no-c-format
msgid "No. &kappname; does not have an 'Undo' feature."
msgstr ""

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:311
#, no-c-format
msgid "Can I use keyboard?"
msgstr ""

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:312
#, no-c-format
msgid "Yes. &kappname; can only be controlled by keyboard."
msgstr ""

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:315
#, no-c-format
msgid "What are the control keys?"
msgstr ""

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:316
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"For the list of the default shortcuts please refer to <link linkend=\"keys"
"\">Default Shortcuts</link> section."
msgstr ""

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:319
#, no-c-format
msgid "I cannot figure out what to do here! Are there hints?"
msgstr ""

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:320
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"No. &kappname; does not have a 'Hint' feature. However, if you carefully "
"read through the <link linkend=\"rules_and_tips\">Game Rules, Strategies and "
"Tips</link> section you shouldn't have this problem."
msgstr ""

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:323
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"I have to quit the game now, but I am not finished yet. Can I save my "
"progress?"
msgstr ""

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:324
#, no-c-format
msgid "No. &kappname; does not have a 'Save' feature."
msgstr ""

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:327
#, no-c-format
msgid "I want to change the game configuration. Where do I go?"
msgstr ""

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:328
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"Use the <link linkend=\"settings-menu-settings\">Settings->Configure "
"&kappname;...</link> option on the menubar to access game settings."
msgstr ""

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:331
#, no-c-format
msgid "I want to change the toolbar layout. What do I do?"
msgstr ""

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:332
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"Use the <link linkend=\"settings-menu-toolbar\">Settings->Configure "
"Toolbars...</link> option on the menubar to access game settings."
msgstr ""

#. Tag: title
#: index.docbook:339 index.docbook:353
#, no-c-format
msgid "Game Configuration"
msgstr ""

#. Tag: title
#: index.docbook:342
#, no-c-format
msgid "Game Keys"
msgstr ""

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:343
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"&kappname; has a default set of keys to control the game. For a list of "
"default keys see the section entitled <link linkend=\"keys\">Default "
"Shortcuts</link>."
msgstr ""

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:344
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"Keys can be configured by selecting <menuchoice> <guimenu>Settings</"
"guimenu><guimenuitem>Configure Shortcuts...</guimenuitem> </menuchoice> from "
"the menubar."
msgstr ""

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:345
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"This will bring up a dialog box which lets you configure all hotkeys, "
"including the keys used for steering the space ships, for firing bullets, "
"and for laying mines."
msgstr ""

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:346
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"You can see that each player (Red and Blue), has 5 keystrokes corresponding "
"to Rotate Left, Rotate Right, Accelerate, Shot, and Mines."
msgstr ""

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:347
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"When you are finished configuring your keys, you should click on "
"<guibutton>OK</guibutton> to apply your changes."
msgstr ""

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:348
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"If you want to restore the default keys, simply click on the "
"<guibutton>Default</guibutton> button once. To make these changes permenant, "
"press <guibutton>OK</guibutton>."
msgstr ""

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:349
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"If you want to abandon the changes you made, and return to your previously "
"selected keys, simply click <guibutton>Cancel</guibutton>, and your changes "
"will be lost."
msgstr ""

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:354
#, no-c-format
msgid "All game settings of &kappname; are configurable."
msgstr ""

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:355
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"If you want to change the game settings, simply select "
"<menuchoice><guimenu>Settings</guimenu><guimenuitem>Configure &kappname;...</"
"guimenuitem></menuchoice> from the menubar."
msgstr ""

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:356
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"This will bring up a dialog box with two pages, labelled <guilabel>General</"
"guilabel> and <guilabel>Game</guilabel>. The first page is rather simple, "
"the second one has seven tabs across the top."
msgstr ""

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:357
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"Settings are collected in different configurations. You can choose from "
"several pre-defined configurations."
msgstr ""

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:358
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"If you choose the <guilabel>Custom</guilabel> configuration, you can define "
"all settings for yourself."
msgstr ""

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:359
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"If you have not selected <guilabel>Custom</guilabel>, you will not be able "
"to make any changes to these options."
msgstr ""

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:360
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"If you have found an interesting configuration, mail it to the author of the "
"game. It can be implemented in a future version (send the part [Game] in the "
"file <filename>~/.kde/share/config/kspaceduelrc</filename>)."
msgstr ""

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:361
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"When you are finished altering the options, you should click on "
"<guibutton>OK</guibutton> to apply your changes."
msgstr ""

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:362
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"If you want to restore the default, simply click on the <guibutton>Default</"
"guibutton> button once. To make these changes permenant, press "
"<guibutton>OK</guibutton>."
msgstr ""

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:363
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"If you want to abandon the changes you made, and return to your previous "
"options, simply click <guibutton>Cancel</guibutton>, and your changes will "
"be lost."
msgstr ""

